WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Meera Tutor: Good evening everyone! Welcome to chess class. How are you all?

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Arjun Sharma: Good evening ma'am!

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Meera Tutor: We have a new student today. Kavya, can you introduce yourself?

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Kavya's iPad: Hi, I am Kavya and I like chess.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Meera Tutor: Wonderful Kavya, welcome! Arjun, what did we learn last class?

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Arjun Sharma: We learned forks.

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Meera Tutor: Very good Arjun! Today we will solve puzzles on the board, so watch carefully how the knight moves and attacks two pieces at once, this is called a fork and it wins material.

8
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Kavya's iPad: Ma'am I can't hear you properly.

9
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Meera Tutor: Is it better now Kavya? Kavya, which move is best here?

10
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Kavya's iPad: Knight to f7!

11
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Meera Tutor: Excellent! Well done Kavya!

12
00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:06.000
Meera Tutor: For homework please solve worksheet page 4. Any doubts? See you next class, bye!

13
00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.000
Arjun Sharma: Bye ma'am!
